{"id":"n28943-1-8","stage":2,"title":"지켜보다 · 留心看","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28943-1-8-1","ko":"짐 옮기는 걸 지켜보지만 말고 좀 도와줘.","zh":"别光看着我搬东西了，快帮帮我吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"짐","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}},{"text":"옮기는","meaning":"搬，移，挪","explanation":"옮기다：搬，移，挪；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"1","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮기는","audio":"/audio/2638362210289f1b2b49.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"지켜보지만","meaning":"留心看，注视","explanation":"지켜보다：留心看，注视；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"지켜보다","audio":"/audio/1537124955a8698cceb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28943","senseId":"1","lemma":"지켜보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지켜보지만","audio":"/audio/a378b8e8f160de4440a2.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"도와줘.","meaning":"帮，帮助；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와줘","audio":"/audio/b4cbb35b499a4f0a9df1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，移，挪","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"使从一处到另一处。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"1537124955a8698c","term":"지켜보다","zh":"留心看，注视","audio":"/audio/1537124955a8698cceb9.mp3","entryId":"28943","definition":"注意观察事物或样子等。","pronunciation":["지켜보다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d42cb244d1814c3305e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28943-1-8-2","ko":"알았어, 도와줄게.","zh":"好的，我帮你。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알았어,","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}},{"text":"도와줄게.","meaning":"帮忙，帮助","explanation":"도와주다：帮忙，帮助；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"도와주다","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70744","senseId":"1","lemma":"도와주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와줄게","audio":"/audio/1c2dde12e2124fb2d5fb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"1505f995680e9a46","term":"도와주다","zh":"帮忙，帮助","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3","entryId":"70744","definition":"帮别人做事或助人一臂之力。","pronunciation":["도와주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ca9433c0224990f4bbaf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.66,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28943","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3853,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别光看着我搬东西了，快帮帮我吧。","好的，我帮你。","发生什么不愉快的事了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["别光看着我搬东西了，快帮帮我吧。","好的，我帮你。","发生什么不愉快的事了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
